        "original_id": "42c8539b-3603-59b0-8e50-a76f0c70bcf4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: That Darn Cat!, Perri, The Love Bug, The Million Dollar Duck, Beethoven\n- People: Dean Jones, Felix Salten\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Topics: film adaptations, acting roles\n\nFacts:\n- Felix Salten wrote \"Perri: The Youth of a Squirrel\" in 1938.\n- Walt Disney Productions released Perri in 1957, and the film was based on Felix Salten's 1938 book \"Perri: The Youth of a Squirrel\".\n- Dean Jones appeared in That Darn Cat! in 1965.\n- Dean Jones played Jim Douglas in The Love Bug in 1968.\n- Dean Jones played Albert Dooley in The Million Dollar Duck in 1971 and received a Golden Globe nomination for that role.\n- Dean Jones played Dr. Herman Varnick in Beethoven in 1992.",
